    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電子熱傳學",
    "sub_ename": "HEAT TRANSFER OF ELECTRONIC EQUIPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹多種常用於電子裝備之冷卻技術，包括傳導冷卻，自然對流和輻射冷卻，空氣強制冷卻，液體強制冷卻，和沸騰與凝結冷卻等。\n為了電子產品的熱可靠性，學生必須學會電子熱傳學。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces a variety of cooling techniques commonly used in electronic equipment, including conduction cooling, natural convection and radiation cooling, forced air cooling, forced liquid cooling, and boiling and condensation cooling. For the thermal reliability of electronic products, students must learn electronic heat transfer.",
